%% DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. Failure scenarios are future acceptance paths, NOT_RUN.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Src as Source / requester
  participant In as Receiver + identity resolver
  participant DB as Inbox / command / cap transaction
  participant Owner as Domain + fallback owner
  participant Guard as Rules / consent / authority
  participant Worker as Fenced execution worker
  participant Provider as External provider
  participant Rec as Authorized reconciler
  Note over Src,Rec: DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. Duplicate, missing owner, revocation, lease expiry and UNKNOWN paths.
  Src->>In: Retry same source_event_id/type and scope-bound integration
  In->>DB: Lookup atomic composite key and payload hash
  alt Same key/hash
    DB-->>Src: Same receipt and intake_id; no second Need
  else Same key/different hash
    DB-->>Src: 409 SOURCE_EVENT_CONFLICT; quarantine + owner
  else New durable event
    DB->>Owner: Dispatch intake after persistence
    alt No eligible owner
      Owner->>DB: WAITING_OWNER + responsible fallback + due time
      Owner-->>Src: Accepted inquiry; human assignment pending
    else Eligible owner
      Owner->>DB: Stable handoff + separate human ACK milestones
    end
  end
  Worker->>DB: Claim existing READY command with lease + fence N
  DB-->>Worker: Command exact hash / expected version / reservation / Decision
  Guard->>Guard: Consent revoked or membership/rule/rights changed to revision N+1
  Worker->>Guard: Last-moment recheck current source revisions and authority
  alt Consent revoked / scope denied / decision expired
    Guard-->>Worker: CONSENT_REVOKED / SCOPE_DENIED / DECISION_STALE
    Worker->>DB: Reject effect; append reason, release only proven unused hold
    Note over Worker,Provider: Approval cannot override hard deny. No external call.
  else All checks remain valid
    Worker->>DB: Record DISPATCH_INTENT and stable effect key under fence N
    Worker->>Provider: Authorized call; provider idempotency/conditional mutation when available
    Provider--xWorker: Response lost after possible write
    Worker->>DB: UNKNOWN + unresolved exposure; preserve original command/effect key
    Note over DB,Worker: Lease expiry is not proof of no effect. DB fence cannot recall a call already in flight.
    Rec->>DB: Claim reconciliation with newer fence; old fence rejected
    Rec->>Provider: Readback by provider account/native ID/effect fingerprint
    alt Confirmed effect occurred
      Provider-->>Rec: Matching state/receipt evidence
      Rec->>DB: Append reconciled SUCCEEDED receipt + settle once
    else Confirmed not applied
      Provider-->>Rec: Authoritative no-effect evidence
      Rec->>DB: Read durable cancellation intent/tombstone
      alt Cancellation intent exists
        Rec->>DB: CANCELLED with no-effect evidence; no retry
      else No cancellation intent
        Rec->>Guard: Fresh evaluation of original intent and any new approval
        Rec->>DB: FAILED then same command/effect key attempt only if valid; recheck tombstone
      end
    else Still ambiguous / provider lacks readback
      Provider-->>Rec: Insufficient evidence
      Rec->>DB: MANUAL_REVIEW; keep UNKNOWN hold + owner/deadline
    end
  end
  Src->>In: Attempt a new command key for same unresolved business intent
  In->>DB: Check outstanding effect identity + reservation
  DB-->>Src: Conflict / link original UNKNOWN; no evasion by new key
  Note over Src,Rec: Recovery restores in read/reconcile mode; no automatic outbox replay or blind resend.
